      "identity": "Zenconnekt Remote Support Agent / native Go remote-control implant",
      "evidence": [
        "main.main at 0x1402f3780 calls protection checks, configuration loading, ROOT-certificate installation and the persistent agent loop.",
        "main.readLoop at 0x1402fb600 calls WebSocket Read, DecodeEnvelope and Dispatcher.Dispatch. Dispatch.func5 calls executeScript; that routine constructs cmd and PowerShell command arguments, including ExecutionPolicy Bypass, and calls Cmd.Run. Console and screen/input handlers are also present.",
        "persistence.Setup at 0x140294360 copies the current executable into an APPDATA subdirectory and writes its launch command under HKCU Software\\Microsoft\\Windows\\CurrentVersion\\Run.",
        "RunChecks at 0x140288960 calls antiDebug and antiVM. Traced probe routines exit on debugger/environment checks; timingProbe exits when its two-million-iteration loop exceeds three seconds.",
        "Configuration fields authenticated-decrypt using HKDF-SHA256-derived ChaCha20-Poly1305 outer and AES-GCM inner layers. Reproduced decoded WebSocket and CA download URLs on the same Replit host.",
        "installCertToStore at 0x14025a2c0 opens ROOT and adds the downloaded certificate with ASN.1 encoding flags. main.main obtains its URL from decrypted global configuration.",
        "Branding/signature text claims Zenconnekt and Acronis Web Suite from a private Acronis-named root. These declarations do not establish authorized vendor deployment."
      ],
      "decoded_configuration": [
        "wss://dacf4402-e6b7-4ca7-9a10-f9255917ccea-00-33bcewfwynhs4.worf.replit.dev",
        "https://dacf4402-e6b7-4ca7-9a10-f9255917ccea-00-33bcewfwynhs4.worf.replit.dev/api/admin/ca-cert",
        "https://dacf4402-e6b7-4ca7-9a10-f9255917ccea-00-33bcewfwynhs4.worf.replit.dev"
      ],
      "judgment_context": "Likely malicious on an endpoint: covert remote scripts, layered hidden operator configuration, anti-analysis exit paths and downloaded trust-store modification outweigh the remote-support label. Enrollment/owner authorization and endpoint execution history are unknown.",
      "coverage": "Three new hostile behavior composites; all accurate baseline detections preserved."
